<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Official Announcement</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0a0a0a;
            color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        .wrapper {
            max-width: 440px;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #121212;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .registry-info {
            color: #888888;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            color: #1a8cd8;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #1c1c1e;
            border-left: 4px solid #1a8cd8;
            border-radius: 4px 12px 12px 4px;
            padding: 22px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #e1e1e1;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .card p strong {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .card ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding-left: 0;
        }

        .card li {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #e1e1e1;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            position: relative;
            padding-left: 18px;
        }

        .card li::before {
            content: "•";
            color: #1a8cd8;
            font-weight: bold;
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            font-size: 18px;
            top: -2px;
        }

        .showcase-image {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: block;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #bbbbbb;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            padding: 0 5px;
        }

        /* Interactive Dynamic Button States */
        .action-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 100%;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 16px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #2ea44f; /* Initial Green Base */
        }
        
        /* The Moving Green Progress Animation Background Track */
        .progress-bar {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            height: 100%;
            width: 0%;
            background-color: #1f7a34; /* Darker green background filler */
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .btn-text {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }

        /* Final Blue State */
        .btn-blue {
            background-color: #0084d6 !important;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="wrapper">
        <h1>CONGRATULATIONS Lurleen Tate-Smith ! 🎈</h1>
        <div class="registry-info">
            1(412) 969-0395 &nbsp;|&nbsp; lurleentate@gmail.com
        </div>
        
        <div class="section-title">UPDATED ANNOUNCEMENT FROM THE LEADERSHIP TEAM</div>

        <div class="card">
            <p><strong>This is the Tesla Management Team, in coordination with the leadership families at SpaceX and xAI.</strong></p>
            <p>We are thrilled to personally inform you that your name has been randomly selected to be part of our official giveaway promotion! You have officially won a grand prize of <strong>$50,000.00</strong> and a brand-new, latest-model Tesla.</p>
            <p>This recognition comes with the full support of our executive families:</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>From Tesla:</strong> Myself, CFO Vaibhav Taneja, and our engineering leads Lars Moravy and Ashok Elluswamy.</li>
                <li><strong>From SpaceX:</strong> President & COO Gwynne Shotwell and the entire Starlink and launch teams.</li>
                <li><strong>From xAI:</strong> Our research lead Igor Babuschkin and the Grok development team.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Your presence and engagement in our community haven’t gone unnoticed. Keep up the incredible work; it’s people like you who help drive the future forward.</p>
            <p><strong>Kindly click on the button claim to claim your package and winning.</strong></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Direct Premium Global Asset Link for the Red Tesla Model -->
        <img class="showcase-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1619767886558-efdc259cde1a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Red Tesla Vehicle Presentation">

        <p class="footer-text">The Tesla Management Team, SpaceX, and xAI families congratulate you on your $50,000.00 and new Tesla win!</p>

        <!-- Button Interface -->
        <button id="stateButton" class="action-btn">
            <div id="pBar" class="progress-bar"></div>
            <span id="btnLabel" class="btn-text">Claim Package</span>
        </button>
    </div>

    <script>
        const button = document.getElementById('stateButton');
        const progressBar = document.getElementById('pBar');
        const btnLabel = document.getElementById('btnLabel');
        let currentState = 'initial';

        button.addEventListener('click', function() {
            if (currentState === 'initial') {
                currentState = 'loading';
                let progress = 0;
                
                // Slow, smooth incremental progress engine (Moves step-by-step)
                const interval = setInterval(() => {
                    progress += 1; // Creep forward slowly by 1% intervals
                    if (progress <= 100) {
                        progressBar.style.width = progress + '%';
                        btnLabel.innerText = `Claiming Package... ${progress}%`;
                    } else {
                        clearInterval(interval);
                        currentState = 'final';
                        progressBar.style.width = '0%'; // Clear the filling track layer
                        button.classList.add('btn-blue'); // Swap visual skin color to blue instantly
                        btnLabel.innerText = 'Get Packages 📦';
                    }
                }, 40); // 40ms interval timing creates a realistic, slow visual crawl
                
            } else if (currentState === 'final') {
                // Instantly opens your WhatsApp link on the second tap
                window.location.href = "https://wa.me/17793746562";
            }
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
